description: "FastAPI processor standards"
globs: ["services/processor/**"]
alwaysApply: false
---
# Processor rules
- Never talk to Convex. Never hold object-storage secret keys. Use signed URLs only.
- Validate MIME + magic bytes before decode. Guard decompression bombs.
- FFmpeg via argument arrays / create_subprocess_exec — never shell=True with user paths.
- Missing models return MODEL_UNAVAILABLE. Zero faces return NO_FACES_DETECTED.
- Do not ship BRIA RMBG. Prefer BiRefNet (MIT) with U²-Net fallback.
- Lazy-load heavy models. Prefer CPU classical paths when GPU weights are absent.
